  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3203.42 Project sponsor",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3203.42 “Project sponsor” means:\n\n(a) For purposes of eligibility under Env-A 3205.06(b)(2)a., any person who is a New Hampshire electric consumer; and\n\n(b) For purposes of eligibility under Env-A 3205.06(b)(2)b. and c., any owner or operator of a non-emitting generating system or renewable energy project, including but not limited to any:\n\n(1) Holding company;\n\n(2) Utility system; or\n\n(3) Plant owner, operator, or manager.\n\nSource. #11001, eff 1-1-16; ss by #14632, eff 6-25-26, EXPIRES: 6-25-36 (formerly Env-A 3203.46)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a3200.html"
